    "product_description": {
      "paragraph_list": [
        {
          "text": "Skin1004 madagascar centella asiatica set",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "👉🏻 cleansing oil 30ml",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "👉🏻 ampoule foam 20ml",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "👉🏻 toner 30ml",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "👉🏻 ampoule 30ml",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "👉🏻 soothing cream 30ml",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "new packaging with no pouch anymore ya kak. thanks",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": null,
          "type": 10001,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Cleasning oil: A cleansing oil, made with a blend of Centella Oil from Madagascar, the untouched nature, and 6 different plant based oils, melts away surface impurities and makeup, and cleanses skin with a lightweight formula, leaving skin purified and refreshed.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": null,
          "type": 10001,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Ampoule Foam: This Madagascar Centella Ampoule Foam cleanser contains Centella Asiatica Extract, a symbol of purity in Madagascar and plant-based cleansing ingredients with pH level of 5.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": null,
          "type": 10001,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Toning toner: Main Ingredients Centella Asiatica Extract, PHA (gluconolactone), Hyaluronic acid Product Introduction A Toning Toner that contains Centella Asiatica extract from the unsullied island of Madagascar, and PHA, which helps clean off dead skin cells, for a more hydrated and clean skin Product Characteristics The PHA, noted for its compatibility with sensitive skin, softens and brightens dull skin by exfoliating dead skin cells, while the high concentration level of Centella Asiatica and Hyaluronic acid help to calm and hydrate the skin. How to Use After cleansing, use a generous amount to gently apply to face and lightly massage for absorption.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": null,
          "type": 10001,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
